acme.validation.ticker.message = Ticker must match the format XX00-XXXXX (2 letters, 2 digits, dash, 5–10 alphanumeric characters)
acme.validation.text.message=Text must not be blank and must be at most 255 characters long
acme.validation.header.message=Header must not be blank and must be at most 75 characters long
acme.validation.part.currency.message = The currency must be EUR
acme.validation.invention.parts.message = The invention must have at least one part
acme.validation.invention.dates.message = To publish an invention, both dates must be in the future
acme.validation.invention.ticker.non-unique = The ticker is already used by another invention
acme.validation.strategy.ticker.non-unique = The ticker is already used by another strategy
acme.validation.strategy.parts.message = The strategy must have at least one part
acme.validation.strategy.dates.message = To publish a strategy, both dates must be in the future
acme.validation.auditReport.auditSection.error = Audit reports cannot be published unless they have at least one audit section.
acme.validation.auditReport.dates.error = Start and end moments must form a valid time interval in the future upon publication.
acme.validation.auditReport.ticker.non-unique = The ticker is already in use by another audit report.